{%- comment -%}
  ik_get_nearby: up to three nearby restaurants from the recommendations service.
  Inputs: the user's ID.
  Outputs: nearby (array), or nothing if the call fails or returns no restaurants.
  Notes: cached 15 minutes, not retried. With :retry, Braze aborts the message after repeated failures, which would skip the Explore fallback. Retry only a call the message can't do without. The endpoint is a placeholder.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- connected_content https://api.example.com/v1/recommendations/nearby?user_id={{ ${user_id} | url_encode }}&limit=3 :save recs :cache_max_age 900 -%}
{%- if recs.__http_status_code__ == 200 -%}
  {%- if recs.restaurants.size > 0 -%}{%- assign nearby = recs.restaurants -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
